## Upstream attribution

Content adapted from https://github.com/CloudAI-X/threejs-skills
(also MIT-licensed). The original is a Claude/Anthropic-Markdown cheatsheet
covering animation, fundamentals, geometry, lighting, materials, loading,
interaction, postprocessing, shaders, and textures.

This repository reorganises that content into the Hermes Agent skill format,
adds When-To-Use / Common Pitfalls / Verification Checklist sections, and
folds the ten upstream files into a single hub skill so a single description
is paid per turn instead of ten.

Original copyright: (c) the CloudAI-X contributors, year per their repo.
